# GRN benchmark of the GRouNdGAN paper's simulated PBMC-All dataset. Tracks the scripts, the causal graph and TF list,
# and the configs, logs and figures of the benchmark; the downloaded data, the inferred GRNs and the Slurm logs stay
# local.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.sh
!*.py
!data/causal_graph.pkl
!data/TFs.csv
!results*/benchmark.cfg
!results*/benchmark.log
!results*/*.png
